    "dp_section": "**Data Processing**\n* Merged 6 PRs\n  - fix: always set NextProtos regardless of enableHTTP2 flag\n  - Add dependabot config for website\n  - docs: Add dedicated Spark Operator documentation website\n* Released **spark-operator-2.5.0-rc.0**\n* Merged 6 PRs\n  - Upstream repo sync v2.5.1\n  - Add E2E tests for Kueue multi-tenancy, gang scheduling & queue independence\n  - Add E2E tests for Kueue + SparkApplication FairSharing, PriorityScheduling, Preemption",
    "exec_summary": "The team successfully released spark-operator-2.5.0-rc.0 and ogx v1.1.3 this week, with spark-operator entering release candidate phase after sustained development activity. No critical risks are currently blocking progress across the portfolio."
